{
  "text": "On this day, September 24th: In 2023: NASA's OSIRIS-REx capsule containing samples from the asteroid 101955 Bennu successfully lands back on Earth. In 2014: The Mars Orbiter Mission makes India the first Asian nation to reach Mars orbit, and the first nation in the world to do so in its first attempt. And in 1929: Jimmy Doolittle performs the first flight without a window, proving that full instrument flying from take off to landing is possible.",
